ok - extraction finds R1/R2/R4, excludes .env, and applies frozen cutoffs
ok - diff lines carrying a key or a quoted or unquoted secret are dropped, not sent
ok - probability equal to the cutoff flags, just below does not
ok - r3 extracts enumerations and applies the frozen 0.20 cutoff
ok - absent TYPESAFE_API_KEY skips silently with exit 0 and no record
ok - record is replayable and never carries the key
ok - resolve records outcomes and score reports fixed-versus-dismissed rates
ok - flipping enabled to false removes a rule in one data line
ok - a git-quoted non-ASCII path reaches the record as the real path
ok - requests go through the call shim and its answers reach the record
ok - an unavailable shim is recorded and never raises a finding
ok - a key held only in the home .env still reaches the shim
ok - a non-numeric answer field is recorded as unavailable, never flagged
ok - parallel runs append whole record lines, never interleaved fragments
ok - an interrupted run stops at once and records every finding it printed
